<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80189" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰχύτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παχύς</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thickness</i>, of stalks,
			skin, ropes, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.74
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				183
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.36
			</span></i> ; of hair, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				782a24
			</span></i> ; of animals, <i>fatness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				611a25
			</span></i> : pl., v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				284e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>thickness</i> or <i>sediment</i> of liquor, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.23
			</span></i> ; <i>density</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				6.41
			</span></i> ; <i>thick consistency</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵματος, γάλακτος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				668b2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				676a11
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ascl.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					12.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>thickness of wit, dullness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.70
			</span></i>.</div>
